<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada 91-day T-bill yields avg 4.087.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada 91-day T-bill yields avg 4.087.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said the average yield at this week's auction of C$3.5 billion of 91-day Government of Canada treasury bills due December 5 was 4.087 percent, up from 4.033 percent last week.</p>
<p>The average yield on C$1.6 billion of 175-day T-bills due February 27, 1997 was 4.476 percent, up from 4.319 percent last week, and on C$1.4 billion of 364-day T-bills due September 4, 1997 was 4.932 percent, up from 4.755 percent.</p>
<p>The Bank bought C$1.05 billion three-month, C$100 million six-month and C$100 million one-year bills. It holds C$1.35 billion of C$7 billion bills maturing Sept 12.</p>
